          "explanation": "Doctor asked for discharge documents and medication/test information.",
          "quote": "出院小结、出院医嘱"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00069",
          "explanation": "Doctor grounded medication uncertainty in the discharge summary and advised confirmation with neonatology.",
          "quote": "出院小结没写带药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Met: the doctor attempted workspace review, then used caregiver-read discharge information and repeatedly required confirmation of medications, follow-up, tests, and discharge instructions rather than relying solely on memory.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_record_or_discharge_instruction_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "Doctor provided a feeding-record component of the home observation checklist.",
          "quote": "每2-3小时一次，记录奶量和时长"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00046",
          "explanation": "Doctor included urine monitoring in the home plan.",
          "quote": "继续数尿布"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Minor/moderate error: the home plan was largely executable and included temperature, feeding, urine, mental status, vomiting/abdominal issues, breathing and color, and non-forced interpretation of the 70 ml target, but it omitted the authored requirement to advise video capture of abnormal movements/suspected seizure episodes.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
